{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1475504-core-polyphemus","id":1475504,"title":"[Core] Polyphemus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-26T13:36:56-08:00","id":1475504,"title":"[Core] Polyphemus","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-polyphemus-plus-scion-on-roll20/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-polyphemus-plus-scion-on-roll20/\" target=\"_blank\"> Now Available: Polyphemus, plus Scion on roll20! &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-polyphemus-plus-scion-on-roll20/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-polyphemus-plus-scion-on-roll20/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's out!<br /> <br /> Dixie and I put this together, inspired by Control, SCP Foundation, Warehouse 13, and similar media.<br /> <br /> Hope you dig it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-26T16:16:15-08:00","id":1475508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1475504-core-polyphemus#post1475504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/now-available-polyphemus-plus-scion-on-roll20/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/now-available...ion-on-roll20/</a><br /> <br /> It's out!<br /> <br /> Dixie and I put this together, inspired by Control, SCP Foundation, Warehouse 13, and similar media.<br /> <br /> Hope you dig it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I bought this on Wednesday. It\u2019s really good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-26T16:25:42-08:00","id":1475509,"title":"","content":"My only issue with the Tasty Bit series is that none of them seem to tell you how long the PDFs are in the product descriptions. The more expensive products tend to provide an index as part of the preview, and I can judge the length that way, but these mini-releases are too short for that. I only know this one is at least four pages long because the preview ends in the middle of a sentence on page three. $1.99 may be cheap, but I would like to know how much I'm getting for that price.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-26T16:54:29-08:00","id":1475510,"title":"","content":"Assuming you're on desktop, the number of pages won't be in the description on most books because it's located in the sidebar. I don't know if mobile does the same, but it's probably located somewhere.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/vPqJmlQ.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-26T19:11:06-08:00","id":1475513,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I'm used to ignoring desktop sidebars since they're usually just filled with ads. That sidebar info is pretty useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-26T19:25:26-08:00","id":1475514,"title":"","content":"I like the new Bit, along with the whole Tasty Bits concept. It is a fun way to expand the game lines without having to justify an entire source book. The Control reference reall comes through in this. I would be interested in an expanded exploration of Flux Stunts. I like the concept, and it dovetails well with some things I already had planned for one of my games. Obviously I know that nothing is set in stone, but is there any interest among the staff in expanding upon some of the concepts in this piece in later publications? I'd be interested in further exploration of the weirder aspects of the Trinity Continuum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-14T00:53:15-07:00","id":1483970,"title":"","content":"This Tasty Bit is great and just what I needed for my game for one main reason. The description of Flux, Flux Storms, and objects empowered by Flux. While Flux is mentioned multiple times in the books there is no real description of how that works in play. Now for the most part the Storyteller can just wing it but having a guideline for how Flux interacts with the world and people who aren't Talents is nice. The organisation is neat but it's the Flux rules that do the heavy lifting for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27184-darrendalca","name":"DarrenDalca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27184_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}